        "text" : "<html>\n  <head>\n    \n  </head>\n  <body>\n    <h1>\n      <span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.0)\"><font color=\"#000000\">Kata \n      &quot;Social Time&quot;</font></span>\n    </h1>\n    <div>\n      <span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.0)\"><font color=\"#000000\">Postings \n      in a social media platform should not be displayed with date/time of \n      their creation but by their age. This usecase defines the business logic \n      to display the age, given as a period of seconds in a reader-friendly \n      style.</font></span>\n    </div>\n    <h2>\n      <span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.0)\"><font color=\"#000000\">Process \n      specification</font></span>\n    </h2>\n  </body>\n</html>\n",
        "plainText" : "\nKata \"Social Time\"\nPostings in a social media platform should not be displayed with date/time of their creation but by their age. This usecase defines the business logic to display the age, given as a period of seconds in a reader-friendly style.\nProcess specification",
